BT /F2 13 Tf 72 720 Td (What the numbers do not say) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 694 Td (The table reports averages. Behind the reading time of 61 seconds per page after the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 679 Td (reset sits a wide spread: the fastest readers finished in half that, and the slowest) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 664 Td (took twice as long. The 88 percent of questions answered correctly hides that two of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 649 Td (the twelve documents were answered no better than before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (A table is a good home for a number and a poor home for a caveat. When a passage is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 611 Td (retrieved from this document, a row of the table carries its label and its values) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 596 Td (together only if the parser kept the row together. A parser that reads the cells as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 581 Td (loose words leaves the number 61 with nothing to say what it measures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 558 Td (Averages also hide who gained. Readers who read slowly to begin with gained the most) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 543 Td (from the reset; the fastest readers gained almost nothing, because they rarely lost) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 528 Td (their place in either layout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 505 Td (The satisfaction score came from one question at the end of each document: how easy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 490 Td (was this to read, from one to ten. It measures what readers felt, not what they did,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 475 Td (and the two do not always agree.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 452 Td (Some changes interact. Fewer words per line means more lines per page and so more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 437 Td (pages, and a reader who turns more pages has more chances to lose their place at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 422 Td (top of a new one. The reset still won, but by less than it would have without the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 407 Td (extra pages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 384 Td (Finally, a month between readings is long enough to forget details but not the gist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 369 Td (Some of the gain in correct answers may come from meeting the document a second) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 354 Td (time, which is why half the readers saw the reset layout first.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 331 Td (None of this undoes the result. It says how far the numbers can be trusted, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 316 Td (which questions the study cannot answer on its own.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 500 40 Td (Page 2) Tj ET
endstream
